|      | 1970-01-01T00:00:00 | 18.0                                      |
| x    | 1970-01-01T00:00:00 | 6.0                                       |
| y    | 1970-01-01T00:00:00 | 100.0                                     |
+------+---------------------+-------------------------------------------+

